        {
            "title": "The 1.1 Update is live!",
            "date": "2014-08-04 13:49:27",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/552008143065529640",
            "notes": "The [b]biggest update so far[/b] to Not the Robots has just gone online!\r\n\r\n[img=http://i.imgur.com/58BAe3B.jpg]\r\n\r\nSome highlights:\r\n\r\n* Our community's most-requested feature: [b]Save&Quit for Campaign Mode[/b]\r\n* We ported the game to our first Android device (Amazon's FireTV) - as a carryover benefit, desktop users who weren't already running the game on max settings should see a [b]general performance boost[/b]\r\n* A overhaul to the general loading screen with tips & tricks, cooler transitions, and one of those fun \"loading spinner\" animations\r\n* Revamped background decorations during gameplay (probably the ugliest part of the original game!)\r\n* The \"Unlock All\" cheat code now unlocks [b]You Find Yourself In A Room 2[/b], a hidden sequel that was previously only accessible by completing all 20 Challenge levels\r\n* [b]Many other tweaks and improvements[/b], including an improved \"x-ray\" effect for the player character, prettier spacial UI elements (like Scanners, Sequence numbers, and tutorial popups), and more\r\n\r\n[url=https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U3Wb4NAuYnmh5KxdiDYXb5IlUaLWbDQOf2upc7GAMY4]The full changelog is available here[/url]"
        },
        {
            "title": "The 1.1 Update is live!",
            "date": "2014-08-04 13:49:27",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3819571572130779746",
            "notes": "The [b]biggest update so far[/b] to Not the Robots has just gone online!\r\n\r\n[img=http://i.imgur.com/58BAe3B.jpg]\r\n\r\nSome highlights:\r\n\r\n* Our community's most-requested feature: [b]Save&Quit for Campaign Mode[/b]\r\n* We ported the game to our first Android device (Amazon's FireTV) - as a carryover benefit, desktop users who weren't already running the game on max settings should see a [b]general performance boost[/b]\r\n* A overhaul to the general loading screen with tips & tricks, cooler transitions, and one of those fun \"loading spinner\" animations\r\n* Revamped background decorations during gameplay (probably the ugliest part of the original game!)\r\n* The \"Unlock All\" cheat code now unlocks [b]You Find Yourself In A Room 2[/b], a hidden sequel that was previously only accessible by completing all 20 Challenge levels\r\n* [b]Many other tweaks and improvements[/b], including an improved \"x-ray\" effect for the player character, prettier spacial UI elements (like Scanners, Sequence numbers, and tutorial popups), and more\r\n\r\n[url=https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U3Wb4NAuYnmh5KxdiDYXb5IlUaLWbDQOf2upc7GAMY4]The full changelog is available here[/url]"
        },
