            "notes": "Heyo, [b]Not the Robots has been updated to version 1.0.3[/b].  This patch focuses on several of the remaining bugs that have been reported by Steam users.  The full patch description can be found [url=http://steamcommunity.com/app/257120/discussions/0/558749825216090884/]here[/url].\r\n\r\nDavid, the sound guy, also just released the game's [b]Official Soundtrack[/b] on BandCamp - [url=https://dvgmusic.bandcamp.com/album/not-the-robots-soundtrack]get it here for $4![/url]\r\n\r\nUp next:  Patch 1.1 will include a much-requested Save&Quit feature.  Cheers!"
        },
