            "notes": " \n<a href='http://store.steampowered.com/app/257120/'>Not The Robots</a> is Now Available on Steam and is 40% off!*<br><br>You are in a seemingly endless campus of office buildings. Your goal is to eat furniture and not get caught. What is going on?<br><br>Not The Robots is a Roguelike Stealth Furniture Eating Simulator. Explore procedurally generated office buildings. Hide behind furniture. Eat the furniture. Get away without being caught. <br><br>*Offer ends December 19th at 10 am PST.<br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/257120/\"><img src=\"http://cdn.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/257120/capsule_467x181.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 181px; width: 467px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
